                        "entry_id": "404c1a3e-bf04-3296-a676-6fefb4edd5e5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Contraction of kind of."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "colloquial",
                            "contraction"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d985e205-5735-4119-9d23-e3092ddfbf06",
                                "sense_id": "ed5e4494-1397-37e2-bef9-165b19be43c7",
                                "text": "Carmiesha had never once busted him in a lie, and she never had no kinda drama with him and no other chick. She damn sure couldn't say that for Dre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "136767c7-f5a8-4b58-b833-165fa8325965",
                                "sense_id": "ed5e4494-1397-37e2-bef9-165b19be43c7",
                                "text": "What kinda music do ya want ta play? Do ya want volume or somethin' more subtle?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "ec19098e-a639-3510-9924-a7df4fc65ead",
                "word": "kinda",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ccd030e-bb8c-3e80-b998-ec473b2952e3",
                        "entry_id": "ec19098e-a639-3510-9924-a7df4fc65ead",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Yes in some respects but no in other respects."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1890c540-c10d-4991-82a1-305510157fc3",
                                "sense_id": "9ccd030e-bb8c-3e80-b998-ec473b2952e3",
                                "text": "\"Are you afraid of a little bit of rain?\" \"Kinda, yeah.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "84b9e34f-dc9b-4725-b63f-d30a68639f7d",
                                "sense_id": "9ccd030e-bb8c-3e80-b998-ec473b2952e3",
                                "text": "Ah, I see. Meely doesn't tease you. You're best friends, is that right? / Kinda."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "6ab5f554-f84d-380e-92cb-a67ea51a6a55",
